Package: lumo-live
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Lumo OS Team <salom600@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: openssh-client
Recommends: openssh-server
Description: Lumo OS live session bootstrap and test mode
 Creates the live user (with passwordless sudo), configures SDDM autologin
 for the live medium, and implements the opt-in automated test mode
 (lumo.test=1 kernel flag): ephemeral SSH key from the kernel command line
 and a serial-console resource report for CI validation. Strictly a no-op
 on installed systems.
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/salom600/lumo-os
